        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur NEWEDN, Eden Prairie Egg Knob With Newport Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor a traditional look with character, Newport Eden Prairie Knob's egg shape is perfect. A prime example of traditional decor that still has a fitting place among today's world, this knobset features the egg knob and rope rose that gives it a classic appeal that goes beyond the normal egg knob. the It has a 10 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty as well. It will fit doors 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-newport-series\"><b>Newport Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur NEWEDN Eden Prairie Egg Knob With Newport Rosette:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Eden Prairie Egg Knob With Newport Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Newport Rosette Diameter: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Eden Prairie Knob Height: 2.68\"</li>\r\n<li>Eden Prairie Knob Width: 1.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Eden Prairie Knob Projection: 2.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-NEWEDN-specifications.pdf?v=1704262183\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur NEWEDN Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Eden Prairie Egg Knob With Newport Rosette, Grandeur NEWEDN",
                "description": "Grandeur NEWEDN, Eden Prairie Egg Knob With Newport Rose - For a traditional look with character, Newport Eden Prairie Knob's egg shape is perfect. A prime example of traditional decor that still has a fitting place among today's world, this knobset features the egg knob and rope rose that gives it a classic appeal that goes beyond the normal egg knob. the It has a 10 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty as well. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
                "keywords": "Eden Prairie Egg Knobs, Newport Eden Prairie Knobs, GRA-NEWEDN, Grandeur NEWEDN, egg knobsets, classic knobs, egg knobs, Grandeur Georgetown series, Eden Prairie Egg Knob With Newport Roses, Eden Prairie Egg Knob With Newport Rosettes, Newport Rose with Eden Prairie Egg Knobs,"
